{
  "project": {
    "name": "Pullover Hoodie",
    "slug": "hoodie-pullover",
    "version": "0.1.0",
    "engine": "fc",
    "description": {
      "en": "FC-100 rank #5. The sweatshirt block plus a two-panel hood whose neck edge is solved to match the measured neck opening, and a kangaroo pocket cut on fold. Cuffs and hem band are derived ribs; the hood finishes the neckline.\n\nOfficial visualizer and configurator: Fashion Cabinet",
      "es": "Rango #5 del FC-100. El bloque de sudadera más una capucha de dos paneles cuyo borde de cuello se resuelve para coincidir con la abertura medida del escote, y bolsa canguro cortada al doblez. Puños y pretina son ribs derivados; la capucha remata el escote.\n\nVisualizador y configurador oficial: Fashion Cabinet",
      "fr": "Rang #5 du FC-100. Le bloc du sweat plus une capuche deux panneaux dont le bord d'encolure est résolu pour coïncider avec l'ouverture d'encolure mesurée, et une poche kangourou coupée au pli. Poignets et bord de bas sont des côtes dérivées ; la capuche finit l'encolure.\n\nVisualiseur et configurateur officiel : Fashion Cabinet"
    },
    "difficulty": "intermediate",
    "tags": [
      "hoodie",
      "fleece",
      "hood",
      "fc100",
      "hyperobject",
      "commons"
    ],
    "attribution": {
      "author": "Innovaciones MADFAM",
      "license": "CERN-OHL-W-2.0",
      "lineage": [
        {
          "source": "Original draft for Fashion Cabinet",
          "license": "original"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "modes": [
    {
      "id": "hoodie",
      "label": {
        "en": "Hoodie (all pieces)",
        "es": "Sudadera con capucha (todas las piezas)",
        "fr": "Sweat à capuche (toutes les pièces)"
      },
      "script_file": "main.py",
      "pieces": [
        "front",
        "back",
        "sleeve",
        "hood",
        "pocket",
        "cuff",
        "hem_band"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "pieces": [
    {
      "id": "front",
      "label": {
        "en": "Front",
        "es": "Delantero",
        "fr": "Devant"
      },
      "default_color": "#5f7a6a",
      "cut": {
        "quantity": 1,
        "on_fold": true,
        "mirror": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "back",
      "label": {
        "en": "Back",
        "es": "Trasero",
        "fr": "Dos"
      },
      "default_color": "#4c6255",
      "cut": {
        "quantity": 1,
        "on_fold": true,
        "mirror": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sleeve",
      "label": {
        "en": "Sleeve",
        "es": "Manga",
        "fr": "Manche"
      },
      "default_color": "#79957f",
      "cut": {
        "quantity": 2,
        "mirror": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hood",
      "label": {
        "en": "Hood (side panel)",
        "es": "Capucha (panel lateral)",
        "fr": "Capuche (panneau latéral)"
      },
      "default_color": "#93ac99",
      "cut": {
        "quantity": 2,
        "mirror": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "pocket",
      "label": {
        "en": "Kangaroo Pocket",
        "es": "Bolsa Canguro",
        "fr": "Poche kangourou"
      },
      "default_color": "#adc2b2",
      "cut": {
        "quantity": 1,
        "on_fold": true,
        "mirror": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cuff",
      "label": {
        "en": "Cuff (rib)",
        "es": "Puño (rib)",
        "fr": "Poignet (côtes)"
      },
      "default_color": "#c5d4c9",
      "cut": {
        "quantity": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hem_band",
      "label": {
        "en": "Hem Band (rib)",
        "es": "Pretina (rib)",
        "fr": "Bord-côte de bas (côtes)"
      },
      "default_color": "#c5d4c9",
      "cut": {
        "quantity": 1
      }
    }
  ],
  "parameters": [
    {
      "id": "chest_girth",
      "type": "slider",
      "default": 1000,
      "min": 650,
      "max": 1900,
      "step": 10,
      "measurement": {
        "standard": "iso_8559",
        "code": "chest_bust_girth"
      },
      "label": {
        "en": "Chest girth (mm)",
        "es": "Contorno de pecho (mm)",
        "fr": "Tour de poitrine (mm)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "body_length",
      "type": "slider",
      "default": 670,
      "min": 420,
      "max": 950,
      "step": 10,
      "label": {
        "en": "Body length to band seam (mm)",
        "es": "Largo de cuerpo hasta pretina (mm)",
        "fr": "Longueur de corps jusqu'à la couture de ceinture (mm)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "neck_girth",
      "type": "slider",
      "default": 390,
      "min": 300,
      "max": 540,
      "step": 5,
      "measurement": {
        "standard": "iso_8559",
        "code": "neck_girth"
      },
      "label": {
        "en": "Neck girth (mm)",
        "es": "Contorno de cuello (mm)",
        "fr": "Tour de cou (mm)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sleeve_length",
      "type": "slider",
      "default": 570,
      "min": 200,
      "max": 780,
      "step": 10,
      "label": {
        "en": "Sleeve length to cuff seam (mm)",
        "es": "Largo de manga hasta puño (mm)",
        "fr": "Longueur de manche jusqu'à la couture du poignet (mm)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fleece_ease",
      "type": "slider",
      "default": 160,
      "min": 60,
      "max": 400,
      "step": 10,
      "label": {
        "en": "Total ease (mm)",
        "es": "Holgura total (mm)",
        "fr": "Aisance totale (mm)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hood_height",
      "type": "slider",
      "default": 350,
      "min": 280,
      "max": 450,
      "step": 5,
      "label": {
        "en": "Hood height (mm)",
        "es": "Alto de capucha (mm)",
        "fr": "Hauteur de capuche (mm)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hood_depth",
      "type": "slider",
      "default": 260,
      "min": 200,
      "max": 340,
      "step": 5,
      "label": {
        "en": "Hood depth (mm)",
        "es": "Profundidad de capucha (mm)",
        "fr": "Profondeur de capuche (mm)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cuff_ratio",
      "type": "slider",
      "default": 0.78,
      "min": 0.6,
      "max": 0.95,
      "step": 0.01,
      "advanced": true,
      "label": {
        "en": "Cuff/opening ratio",
        "es": "Proporción puño/abertura",
        "fr": "Rapport poignet/ouverture"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hemband_ratio",
      "type": "slider",
      "default": 0.85,
      "min": 0.7,
      "max": 1.0,
      "step": 0.01,
      "advanced": true,
      "label": {
        "en": "Hem band/hem ratio",
        "es": "Proporción pretina/dobladillo",
        "fr": "Proportion bord-côte/ourlet"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cuff_height",
      "type": "slider",
      "default": 60,
      "min": 30,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 5,
      "label": {
        "en": "Cuff height (mm)",
        "es": "Alto de puño (mm)",
        "fr": "Hauteur du poignet (mm)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hemband_height",
      "type": "slider",
      "default": 60,
      "min": 30,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 5,
      "label": {
        "en": "Hem band height (mm)",
        "es": "Alto de pretina (mm)",
        "fr": "Hauteur de bord-côte de bas (mm)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seam_allowance",
      "type": "slider",
      "default": 8,
      "min": 0,
      "max": 20,
      "step": 1,
      "label": {
        "en": "Seam allowance (mm)",
        "es": "Margen de costura (mm)",
        "fr": "Marge de couture (mm)"
      }
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "id": "size-m",
      "label": {
        "en": "M",
        "es": "M",
        "fr": "M"
      },
      "values": {
        "chest_girth": 1000,
        "body_length": 670,
        "sleeve_length": 570
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "size-l",
      "label": {
        "en": "L",
        "es": "G",
        "fr": "L"
      },
      "values": {
        "chest_girth": 1080,
        "body_length": 700,
        "sleeve_length": 590
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "oversized",
      "label": {
        "en": "Oversized",
        "es": "Oversize",
        "fr": "Oversize"
      },
      "values": {
        "fleece_ease": 280,
        "body_length": 710,
        "hood_height": 380
      }
    }
  ],
  "constraints": [
    {
      "expression": "hood_depth <= hood_height",
      "severity": "warning",
      "message": {
        "en": "Very deep hoods relative to height collapse forward",
        "es": "Capuchas muy profundas respecto a su alto se vencen hacia adelante",
        "fr": "Les capuches très profondes par rapport à leur hauteur s'affaissent vers l'avant"
      }
    }
  ],
  "export_formats": [
    "svg",
    "dxf",
    "json"
  ],
  "fabrics": [
    "felpa-algodon"
  ],
  "hyperobject": {
    "is_hyperobject": true,
    "domain": "garment",
    "interfaces": [
      {
        "id": "neckline",
        "type": "neckline",
        "edges": [
          {
            "piece": "front",
            "edge": "neck"
          },
          {
            "piece": "back",
            "edge": "neck"
          },
          {
            "piece": "hood",
            "edge": "neck"
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          "neck_girth",
          "hood_height",
          "hood_depth"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "armscye",
        "type": "armscye",
        "edges": [
          {
            "piece": "front",
            "edge": "armhole"
          },
          {
            "piece": "back",
            "edge": "armhole"
          },
          {
            "piece": "sleeve",
            "edge": "cap"
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          "chest_girth",
          "fleece_ease"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "cuff",
        "type": "cuff",
        "edges": [
          {
            "piece": "sleeve",
            "edge": "hem"
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          "cuff_ratio",
          "cuff_height"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "hem",
        "type": "hem",
        "edges": [
          {
            "piece": "front",
            "edge": "hem"
          },
          {
            "piece": "back",
            "edge": "hem"
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          "hemband_ratio",
          "hemband_height"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "capabilities": {
      "made_to_measure": true,
      "fold_cutting": true,
      "fabric_compensation": false,
      "knit_negative_ease": false
    },
    "societal_benefit": {
      "en": "The commons' first head-adjacent piece: a hood whose neck seam is solved against the measured opening, establishing the attach-a-piece-to-a-measured-curve rule that collars and plackets will reuse across the FC-100.",
      "es": "La primera pieza del commons adyacente a la cabeza: una capucha cuya costura de cuello se resuelve contra la abertura medida, estableciendo la regla de unir-pieza-a-curva-medida que cuellos y carteras reutilizarán en el FC-100.",
      "fr": "La première pièce du commons adjacente à la tête : une capuche dont la couture d'encolure est résolue face à l'ouverture mesurée, établissant la règle « attacher une pièce à une courbe mesurée » que les cols et les pattes de boutonnage réutiliseront dans tout le FC-100."
    },
    "commons_license": "CERN-OHL-W-2.0"
  }
}
